---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 习作展示 · 笔法
description: 笔法写作练习匿名提交展示页——看看别人怎么写同一道题。
---

<section class="page-hero" data-component="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Showcase · 习作展示</span>
      <h1>习作展示</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">这里展示匿名提交的写作练习习作。没有用户名、没有头像——只有文字本身。看看别人怎么写同一道题，给自己找参考和灵感。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block showcase-block" id="showcase" data-component="showcase" style="padding-top:calc(var(--seed-density) * 0.7)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="block-head reveal">
      <span class="idx">01</span>
      <h2>全部习作</h2>
      <div class="rule"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 分类筛选 -->
    <div class="filter-row reveal" data-component="showcase-filter" role="tablist" aria-label="按分类筛选习作">
      <button class="ftab active" data-filter="全部">全部<small>{{ showcase.length }}</small></button>
      {% set cats = ["人物","对话","情节","世界观","节奏","修改"] %}
      {% for c in cats %}
      {% set count = 0 %}
      {% for s in showcase %}{% if s.cat == c %}{% set count = count + 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      <button class="ftab" data-filter="{{ c }}">{{ c }}<small>{{ count }}</small></button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="skill-count" id="showcaseCount" data-total="{{ showcase.length }}">显示 {{ showcase.length }} / {{ showcase.length }} 篇习作</p>

    <!-- 习作卡片网格 -->
    <div class="showcase-grid reveal" id="showcaseGrid">
      {% for s in showcase %}
      <article class="showcase-card" data-component="showcase-card" data-cat="{{ s.cat }}">
        <div class="sc-top">
          <span class="cat-chip">{{ s.cat }}</span>
          <span class="sc-date">{{ s.date | dateFilter }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-prompt">
          <span class="sc-prompt-label">练习题</span>
          <p>{{ s.prompt }}</p>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="sc-excerpt">{{ s.excerpt }}</blockquote>
        <div class="sc-foot">
          <span class="sc-words">{{ s.wordCount | thousands }} 字</span>
          <span class="sc-anon">匿名习作</span>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="skills-empty" id="showcaseEmpty">该分类下暂无习作</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band" data-component="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal cta-inner">
      <h2>你也来写一题？</h2>
      <p>抽一道随机练习题，写完匿名提交，你的习作也会出现在这里。</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/#practice">去写作练习 <span class="arr">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/faq/">关于展示页的常见问题 <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
